{
  "_meta": {
    "protocol": "bnuz",
    "fixture": "bnuz_normal.html",
    "source": "http://es.bnuz.edu.cn/ 个人课表页脱敏手写 (ASP.NET WebForm, #table1)",
    "parser": "JwBnuzParser (移植自 dIT8Zv/WakeupSchedule_BUPT BNUZParser.kt)",
    "fields": ["name", "day", "startNode", "endNode", "startWeek", "endWeek", "type", "teacher", "room"],
    "_parsing_notes": [
      "BNUZParser 解析路径: doc.getElementById('table1').getElementsByTag('tr') → 每行 td 序列",
      "otherHeader 集合(['时间','星期一'..'星期日','早晨','上午','下午','晚上']) 跳过",
      "节次数字 td (matches '\\d+') 触发 node=toInt() + countFlag=true, 不计入 day 推进",
      "课程 td html = '<span>...</span>courseName<br>teacher{weekList}<br>room(step节)<br>[more sections]'",
      "substringAfter('</span>').substringBeforeLast('<br>').split('<br>') → [courseName, teacher, room, teacher, room, ...]",
      "for i in 1..infos.size step 2: teacher=infos[i].substringBefore('{'), room=infos[i+1]",
      "step=room.substringAfterLast('(').substringBeforeLast(')').toInt()",
      "weekList=infos[i].substringAfter('{').substringBefore('}').split(','); 范围('1-16')或单值('5')",
      "type: 单→1, 双→2, 否则 0; 单值周 endWeek=startWeek"
    ]
  },
